        },
        "label": "What we believe",
        "linkType": "internal"
      },
      "size": "short"
    },
    {
      "_key": "wwa-scripture",
      "_type": "scriptureBandSection",
      "accentWord": "proclaim",
      "reference": "Isaiah 12:4",
      "verse": "Give praise to the Lord, proclaim his name; make known among the nations what he has done, and proclaim that his name is exalted."
    },
    {
      "_key": "wwa-watchword",
      "_type": "richTextSection",
      "body": [
        {
          "_key": "ww-1-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ww-1-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "This statement is our congregational “watchword.” A watchword is a short reminder and a promise from scripture about who God is and who he has called his people to be."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ww-2-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ww-2-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "When the people of God were in exile, the Prophet Isaiah spoke. He delivered a message from God about what it would be like \"In that day\" when they returned. The people would return, praising and proclaiming the name of the Lord, and making him known to all nations."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ww-3-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ww-3-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "At First Baptist Church Muncie, we believe the day of the Lord's favor has come in Jesus. The short of it is: that Jesus really does change everything."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ww-4-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ww-4-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "And our goal for this season is to praise and proclaim his name."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ww-5-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ww-5-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "This watchword, “Praise & Proclaim” reminds us of the importance of each:"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ww-6",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ww-6s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Praise"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ww-7-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ww-7-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "That our Purpose is worship, lifting up name of God: Father, Son, & Holy Spirit."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ww-8",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ww-8s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Proclaim"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ww-9-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ww-9-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "That our Joy is to share the Good News of Jesus, with our neighbors & the world."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "eyebrow": "Our watchword",
      "heading": "Praise and proclaim"
    },
    {
      "_key": "wwa-goals",
      "_type": "richTextSection",
      "body": [
        {
          "_key": "p4-h1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-h1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Worship"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-a-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-a-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "FBCM gives praise to the Lord by gathering to worship as the full, intergenerational body of Christ."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-b-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-b-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Following God's Word - Our times of worship are rooted in scripture and prayer-filled so that our body can collectively hear from God, discern the next right step, and follow the Holy Spirit."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-h2",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-h2s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Way"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-c-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-c-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "FBCM proclaims God's faithfulness with people who are curious about faith, as well as new believers. We offer a growth track, a step by step path into the life of this church, to help us all “come and see” who Jesus is and grow spiritually (John 1:39-41)."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-d-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-d-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Caring Mentorship – Each regular attendee is connected with a deacon, a church member chosen to care for others, who offers prayer and support."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-h3",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-h3s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Witness"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-e-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-e-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "To make known what God has done, FBCM builds Christ-sharing relationships with people in Muncie and beyond to spread the good news."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-f-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-f-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Local Partnership – We believe God has placed us in downtown Muncie for a reason. We work with local groups to bring light and hope to our community."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-h4",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-h4s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Work"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-g-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-g-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "FBCM exalts God by following Jesus’ example of serving others, rather than seeking to be served ourselves (Mark 10:45)."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-h-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-h-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Serve – We actively and practically help and work alongside our neighbors."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-i-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-i-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Support – We give sacrificially to help those in need through regular offerings and donations."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p4-j-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "p4-j-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Share – We care for church members who are sick, home bound, or struggling, making sure they remain part of our life together."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "eyebrow": "Our goals",
      "heading": "Four commitments"
    },
    {
      "_key": "wwa-pastors",
      "_type": "staffGridSection",
      "eyebrow": "Our leadership",
      "group": "pastors",
      "heading": "Our pastors and worship arts director",
      "showBios": true
    },
    {
      "_key": "wwa-letter",
      "_type": "richTextSection",
      "body": [
        {
          "_key": "lt-a-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "lt-a-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "If you’re looking not only for a place to attend a service, but for a community of faith, we would love to welcome you to First Baptist. And, if you’re unsure what you believe (or even if you consider yourself a great skeptic!), but are wondering if there may be something more out there, we’d love for you to join us for worship too!"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "lt-b-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "lt-b-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "We’re all about the church. This church is made up of people who are all imperfect, all of us with our own struggles, all of us failing, falling into our old selfish ways, and getting up again only by God’s grace. And those same people are also filled by God’s own Spirit, have a sincere desire to be “good news” people, and to serve one another as we grow in our love of Christ together."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "lt-c-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "lt-c-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Finally, we would love for you to join us this Sunday, or anytime we’re gathered to encounter the same Christ who was, and is, and will come again – as we meet him in worship, the word, and the Lord’s table. “Come and see!”"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "lt-d-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "lt-d-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "lt-d-1l1"
              ],
              "text": "Read the full letter on the Staff page"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "lt-d-1l1",
              "_type": "link",
              "href": "/staff"
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "eyebrow": "A note from our pastors",
      "heading": "From Kendall and Jonathan"
    },
    {
      "_key": "wwa-pledge",
      "_type": "richTextSection",
      "body": [
        {
          "_key": "pl-a-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pl-a-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "We pledge ourselves to be the family of God for you in this place:"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "pl-b-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pl-b-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Bearing your burdens, as you bear ours. (Galatians 6:2)"
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "pl-b-2",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pl-b-2s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Encouraging you in the faith, as we are encouraged by you. (1 Thess. 5:11)"
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "pl-b-3",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pl-b-3s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Delighting in the Lord’s ways (Ps. 86:11-13; Ps. 37:3-6)"
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "pl-b-4",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pl-b-4s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Offering our lives as a living sacrifice: Holy & Pleasing to God. (Romans 12:1)"
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "pl-c-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pl-c-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "When a member joins, we say this pledge together as a church."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "eyebrow": "Our pledge",
      "heading": "What we promise"
    },
